('Palindrome LL','Checking if a linked list is a palindrome in O(n) O(1) space:','MCQ','MEDIUM','DSA','Linked List','["Use a stack","Find middle, reverse second half, compare with first half","Sort and compare","Convert to array"]','Find middle, reverse second half, compare with first half'),
