('LRU Cache LL','LRU Cache uses a doubly linked list + hash map for:','MCQ','MEDIUM','DSA','Linked List','["O(n) get and put","O(1) get and put","O(log n) get and put","O(n log n) get and put"]','O(1) get and put'),
('Partition LL','Partitioning a linked list around value x (like quicksort pivot) in O(n):','MCQ','MEDIUM','DSA','Linked List','["Requires extra list","Two dummy heads; collect smaller and larger nodes, then link","Sort first","Use recursion"]','Two dummy heads; collect smaller and larger nodes, then link'),
