('LL Cycle Length','Once a cycle is detected, finding cycle length from meeting point:','MCQ','MEDIUM','DSA','Linked List','["Restart Floyd''s","Keep one pointer fixed, move the other until it returns — count steps","Use a hash set","Use slow pointer only"]','Keep one pointer fixed, move the other until it returns — count steps'),
