('Add Numbers LL','Adding two numbers represented as linked lists (digits in reverse): result?','MCQ','HARD','DSA','Linked List','["Requires conversion to int","Traverse both simultaneously, carry the remainder — O(max(m,n))","O(m*n)","Impossible without extra space"]','Traverse both simultaneously, carry the remainder — O(max(m,n))'),
