('Self Organize LL','A self-organizing list heuristic (move-to-front) has amortized O(1) for:','MCQ','HARD','DSA','Linked List','["All operations","Frequently accessed elements — reduces average access time","Never","Sorted access patterns only"]','Frequently accessed elements — reduces average access time'),
('DLL vs SLL Delete','Deleting a node given only its pointer: possible in O(1) for:','MCQ','HARD','DSA','Linked List','["Both SLL and DLL","DLL — prev pointer allows direct unlinking; SLL requires prev to be found or trick","Neither","Only for head node"]','DLL — prev pointer allows direct unlinking; SLL requires prev to be found or trick'),
('Swap K Nodes','Swapping kth node from beginning and kth from end in O(n) without actual node swap:','MCQ','HARD','DSA','Linked List','["Swap the nodes physically","Swap only the data values of the two nodes — O(n) to find both","Reverse the list","Use recursion"]','Swap only the data values of the two nodes — O(n) to find both'),
